This directory holds pages published through POST /api/wiki (the /app/wiki
"New Page" form, or plugins/wiki.ts's WikiPlugin acting on the AI's own
behalf) -- see models && skills/core/wiki-store.ts. Kept separate from the
curated pages one level up so a self-published page can never be confused
with, or silently overwrite, hand-reviewed documentation.

This file exists only so git tracks the empty directory before any page has
been published into it; it is not itself a wiki page (it isn't a .md file,
so listWikiPages() ignores it).
